  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ashoka | Organic Fertilizer Production Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: fertilizer. Beneficiaries: 114 (including 22 women). Description: ABC Grower addresses the lack of fertilizer access in Benin, which results in low yields of organic farming. The organization uses new technologies to create more efficient and sustainable agricultural solutions, having developed a range of 19 specific organic fertilizers for 14 different crops. The result is an increase organic farm production by 50%, lowering the production costs, and raising market competition to both non-organic and organic foods. The fertilisers are easy to handle and can be produced on a large scale. The organization has partnered with rural populations from surrounding communities to train them in applying their bio-mineralization technology to create eco-friendly business models.</narrative>
  </description>
